    "questions": [
      {
        "id": 17811,
        "quiz_id": 4814,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Some people believe that unpaid community service should be a compulsory part of high school programmes (for example working for charity, improving the neighborhood, or teaching sports to young children). To what extent do you agree or disagree?",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FJGzdnT4MooL3axvmuLleDTjg0c\"><em><strong>Some people believe that unpaid community service should be a compulsory part of high school programmes (for example working for charity, improving the neighborhood, or teaching sports to young children).&nbsp;</strong><strong>To</strong><strong> what extent do you agree or disagree?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Unpaid Community Service Debate&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GdyRdbsZvoIxiwxeyISlrvrvgTq\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Đề Unpaid Community Service Debate&nbsp;cho 1 quan điểm:</strong>&nbsp;C&aacute;c hoạt động phục vụ cộng đồng kh&ocirc;ng lương n&ecirc;n l&agrave; một phần bắt buộc trong chương tr&igrave;nh học cấp ba (v&iacute; dụ như l&agrave;m việc cho tổ chức từ thiện, cải thiện khu d&acirc;n cư, hoặc dạy thể thao cho trẻ nhỏ).</li>\n<li><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-9dbe214e-7fff-6588-d2cc-f192ffcb2f84\">Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi: </strong>Bạn đồng &yacute; hay kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với &yacute; kiến n&agrave;y&nbsp;\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-OJWHdYuX3o3IJdxpWr1lh6eGg7g\">đến mức độ n&agrave;o?</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RnoTdfRUCo8h33xpxtNlJ5urg3c\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Unpaid Community Service Debate&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EL8qdVKzzo7cO1xJeQ9l03l7gQh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ychndsy5UoAPmAxtdX7lSgPKgJb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MPtWd6sp2o8yf3xonNslJ1nRgGd\"><em>(*) Bạn học&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-to-what-extent\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">c&aacute;ch viết Introduction cho dạng To what extent </a></strong></span>ở đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;.</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OoFxd6G5IosqkDxxr7IlYJpdgkg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OoFxd6G5IosqkDxxr7IlYJpdgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0GLd7Iu6oWxFWxuxqWlStnrgbb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>mandatory community service <em>(dịch vụ cộng đồng bắt buộc)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EB3zdgSE8oDcK3x9P4DlIpWAgZe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HzOidr8ZxoTPSFxUkoXlvE4NgYe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5bHdyGhgoMPdixKUZYlMlHwgRh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AQZSdgBLBobdFaxUWOollK9xgGg\">Bạn n&ecirc;n n&oacute;i r&otilde; quan điểm của m&igrave;nh l&agrave; đồng &yacute;, hoặc kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với quan điểm của đề. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm <strong>'kh&ocirc;ng&nbsp;đồng &yacute;'</strong>, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng&nbsp;\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-RLJpdX62do8OIgxb5IVlxmjwg4b\"><strong>'c&aacute;c hoạt động phục vụ cộng đồng kh&ocirc;ng lương kh&ocirc;ng n&ecirc;n l&agrave; một phần bắt buộc trong chương tr&igrave;nh học cấp ba'</strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YpaCdQhn7od22KxmmfklBnQqgJb\"><em>(*) Bạn t&igrave;m hiểu về bản chất của <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> ở b&agrave;i học thử n&agrave;y nh&eacute;: <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cach-lap-luan-4060\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic lập luận dạng 'To What Extent'</a></strong></span></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Egm3dcGnFo6opxxlVUml42Ljgwq\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60 </strong>th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\"><strong>BODY 1: </strong>M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về một số lợi &iacute;ch <span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">nhỏ</span><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> của việc bắt buộc học sinh cấp ba tham gia c&aacute;c hoạt động phục vụ cộng đồng kh&ocirc;ng lương.</span></li>\n<li><strong>BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng việc khiến c&aacute;c hoạt động phục vụ cộng đồng kh&ocirc;ng lương trở th&agrave;nh một phần bắt buộc trong chương tr&igrave;nh học cấp ba tạo ra những nhược điểm <span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">đ&aacute;ng kể</span><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZeqHdZJfvoR6ikxE9sClk29bgvc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LEQ0dwS7nowPZExW2i9l8z0vgEf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy; </sup></strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OLymdBW54ogutCx2USClYflAgPf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ErfadJPNhoGippx8HFylh5IGgxe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/185/writing-advanced-task-2?collection=lesson&amp;item=161\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AFbjddKqRoA9AbxpHWPlVjUXgbe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/185/writing-advanced-task-2?collection=lesson&amp;item=162\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PCV9deP2nouqvrxg8eUlsNuegXd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/185/writing-advanced-task-2?collection=lesson&amp;item=645\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J20Yds7vLoEOrrxK31XleiYqgtg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-2c2a0477-7fff-66ee-1aea-7a98c78dbe38\">B&agrave;n về một số lợi &iacute;ch nhỏ của việc bắt buộc học sinh cấp ba tham gia c&aacute;c hoạt động phục vụ cộng đồng kh&ocirc;ng lương.</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TvJGd3R4zoECjjxyRoOl2efgguc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VkpUdS4fwovSvPx9UywlQao3gLb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UlihdFPJuoTdewxs8hOlbfNFgPL\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XAtJdZPu5okOZUxf8TslkFSsgZ7\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, việc y&ecirc;u cầu học sinh tham gia <em>c&ocirc;ng việc cộng đồng (community work)</em> c&oacute; thể mang lại những kết quả t&iacute;ch cực cho sự ph&aacute;t triển c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của c&aacute;c em.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OwFAd0PNEo4IKExXDzylPtVOgrh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PegadZsNUo15aMxdV8Zlaq2ugKd\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> <em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">Dịch vụ kh&ocirc;ng được trả c&ocirc;ng (Unpaid service)</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> gi&uacute;p </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">x&acirc;y dựng nh&acirc;n c&aacute;ch v&agrave; l&ograve;ng đồng cảm (build character and empathy)</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> ở học sinh bằng c&aacute;ch cho c&aacute;c em tiếp x&uacute;c với c&aacute;c t&igrave;nh huống x&atilde; hội đa dạng.</span></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PegadZsNUo15aMxdV8Zlaq2ugKd\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Reason: </strong>Điều n&agrave;y l&agrave; do việc l&agrave;m việc với <em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">những người k&eacute;m may mắn (disadvantaged people )</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> cho ph&eacute;p học sinh hiểu r&otilde; hơn về </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">c&aacute;c vấn đề x&atilde; hội (social problems)</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">, khiến c&aacute;c em trở th&agrave;nh </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">những c&aacute; nh&acirc;n c&oacute; l&ograve;ng trắc ẩn (compassionate individuals)</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> hơn v&agrave; chuẩn bị tốt hơn cho c&aacute;c tr&aacute;ch nhiệm người lớn trong sự nghiệp tương lai.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O4Ovdm22Eo3LHGxhGQ7l3Xiwgwh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YPIadKbLGo3InQxb1MMlHH29gAf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> &nbsp;Th&ecirc;m v&agrave;o đ&oacute;, những chương tr&igrave;nh như vậy ph&aacute;t triển <em>c&aacute;c kỹ năng thực tế (practical skills)</em> v&agrave; <em>khả năng l&agrave;m việc nh&oacute;m (teamwork abilities)</em> được đ&aacute;nh gi&aacute; cao trong m&ocirc;i trường chuy&ecirc;n nghiệp.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YPIadKbLGo3InQxb1MMlHH29gAf\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Example: </strong>V&iacute; dụ, việc tổ chức <em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">c&aacute;c sự kiện từ thiện (charity events)</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> hoặc dạy thể thao cho trẻ nhỏ gi&uacute;p học sinh học được </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">những khả năng giao tiếp v&agrave; l&atilde;nh đạo (communication and leadership abilities)</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> thiết yếu c&oacute; gi&aacute; trị cho sự nghiệp tương lai v&agrave; </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">đơn xin học đại học (university applications)</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ogajd9kkooYFT7xqNLelwX9Agah\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PTcddY6Kqo7nHcxFb3UlpLsggud\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4. Viết BODY 2: </strong><strong><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-392bbcda-7fff-e6bc-b9d6-86c36e7e61f5\">Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng việc khiến c&aacute;c hoạt động phục vụ cộng đồng kh&ocirc;ng lương trở th&agrave;nh một phần bắt buộc trong chương tr&igrave;nh học cấp ba tạo ra những nhược điểm đ&aacute;ng kể.</strong></strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tz5cdshVeoUlfIxSjcZl6FyEgib\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NcXEdRhnVoQ3oyx0pqcl1k7GgMb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I7wVdxu0voPLSOxyXztlxBwcgdb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FBZgdUejJoyWuhxQvKelKRTsgMg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin rằng <em>dịch vụ cộng đồng bắt buộc (compulsory community service)</em> tạo ra những nhược điểm đ&aacute;ng kể hơn, vượt qua những lợi &iacute;ch n&agrave;y.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NicfdCnZdokC5Vx1ZoDlwZZugLe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MYOjdjvJfo9zRlxh86GlT0M0g2e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>Mối quan ngại cấp b&aacute;ch nhất l&agrave; n&oacute; l&agrave;m tăng <em>&aacute;p lực học tập (academic pressure)</em> v&agrave; stress l&ecirc;n <em>những học sinh đ&atilde; qu&aacute; tải (already overwhelmed students)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MYOjdjvJfo9zRlxh86GlT0M0g2e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> L&yacute; do l&agrave; học sinh trung học phổ th&ocirc;ng đ&atilde; phải đối mặt với khối lượng c&ocirc;ng việc nặng nề với nhiều m&ocirc;n học v&agrave; chuẩn bị thi cử, v&agrave; việc th&ecirc;m dịch vụ bắt buộc tạo ra <em>những kh&oacute; khăn quản l&yacute; thời gian (time management difficulties)</em> nghi&ecirc;m trọng c&oacute; thể dẫn đến <em>kiệt sức (burnout)</em> v&agrave; <em>kết quả học tập k&eacute;m (poor academic performance)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VI43d4IPUoR7Ugxtjgmlg4IWgXe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UI1Qdgs12ocJrJxIlxclXWTPgLf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Hơn nữa, những chương tr&igrave;nh như vậy c&oacute; thể <em>cảm thấy bị &eacute;p buộc (feel forced)</em> thay v&igrave; thực sự muốn l&agrave;m, điều n&agrave;y <em>l&agrave;m suy yếu mục đ&iacute;ch như dự định (undermine intended purpose)</em> của ch&uacute;ng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UI1Qdgs12ocJrJxIlxclXWTPgLf\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Impact:</strong> Kết quả l&agrave;, việc loại bỏ sự lựa chọn c&aacute; nh&acirc;n c&oacute; nghĩa l&agrave; học sinh tham gia <em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">một c&aacute;ch miễn cưỡng (reluctantly)</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">động lực hoặc nhiệt t&igrave;nh thực sự (real motivation or enthusiasm)</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">, điều n&agrave;y </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">đ&aacute;nh bại (defeat)</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> mục đ&iacute;ch ph&aacute;t triển </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">sự quan t&acirc;m thực sự (genuine care)</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> đối với cộng đồng v&agrave; </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">tr&aacute;ch nhiệm x&atilde; hội (social responsibility)</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-BHVjdZmI0oMKnrxn4CtlTdn5gUb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5. Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zu8ndrXoDo0OKIxJZtgljemhguh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EMN7dAA9ronLeRxOw4XlmhQIgmd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xoitd0UzQoDp1xxHOunlKjhIgrf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KhHndXqLgoCSjQxkGzAljeoLgyc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbMDdO3yRoXMpTxNVAClKQbagce\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EHVddMg7woB8QUxLFbelvofDgBf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>build character and skills <em>(x&acirc;y dựng nh&acirc;n c&aacute;ch v&agrave; kỹ năng)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KqNcdDmeGoqqmUxECIclGLRmg0g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>academic burden <em>(g&aacute;nh nặng học tập)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IDU7dVCfpopgzGx35FwlWmFhgeg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">counterproductive <em>(phản t&aacute;c dụng)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1447,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtiQdxEhxoxtubxGec6lhruwg6d\">Some people believe that mandatory community service should be integrated into high school curricula. Although this approach could offer certain benefits in terms of character development and skill acquisition, I believe these advantages are far outweighed by the academic pressure and lack of genuine motivation it would create.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17811,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1448,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QueXdjegJoQKoGxgns5ldCG0gLc\"><strong>Admittedly, requiring students to participate in community work can yield some positive outcomes for their personal growth.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Unpaid service helps build character and empathy in students by exposing them to diverse social situations. This is because working with disadvantaged people allows students to understand social problems better, making them more compassionate individuals and better prepared for adult responsibilities in their future careers.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, such programs develop practical skills and teamwork abilities that are highly valued in professional environments. For example, organizing charity events or teaching sports to younger children helps students learn essential communication and leadership abilities that prove valuable for future careers and university applications.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17811,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1449,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GaBndAVCfo2UVOxxVWrlfMTfg5d\"><strong>However, I am convinced that compulsory community service creates more significant drawbacks that outweigh these benefits. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">The most pressing concern is that it increases academic pressure and stress on already overwhelmed students. The reason is that high school students already face heavy workloads with multiple subjects and exam preparation, and adding mandatory service creates serious time management difficulties that may lead to burnout and poor academic performance.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, such programs may feel forced rather than genuine, which undermines their intended purpose. As a result, removing personal choice means students participate reluctantly without real motivation or enthusiasm, which defeats the purpose of developing genuine care for the community and social responsibility.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17811,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1450,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HhHkdhzjtow0TUx86vFl3vKzg6P\">In conclusion, while mandatory community service might build character and skills, the academic burden and forced nature of such programs make them counterproductive overall.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17811,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
        "time_limit": 30
      }
